{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 325, "line_no": 6, "text": "直接用中药，布依族医生在使用时，则采用汉族的称谓及读法。例如，［ra\"'sun”］或［za”", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 495, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "直接用中药，布依族医生在使用时，则采用汉族的称谓及读法。例如，［ra\"'sun”］或［za”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 495, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 325, "line_no": 7, "text": "sun”］，汉语直译“雅党珍”，即指中药党参。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 555, "w": 768, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "sun”］，汉语直译“雅党珍”，即指中药党参。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 555, "w": 768, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 325, "line_no": 8, "text": "动物类药物，布依族一般都有固定称谓。如鸡［kai”］（盖，罗甸龙坪），［tu\"kai ］（独", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 624, "w": 1459, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "动物类药物，布依族一般都有固定称谓。如鸡［kai”］（盖，罗甸龙坪），［tu\"kai ］（独", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 624, "w": 1459, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
